---
// English-only page, required for AdSense review. Self-canonical, no
// Korean counterpart. Isolated under src/pages/en/.
import LayoutEn from "../../layouts/LayoutEn.astro";
import { SITE_URL } from "../../site";

const site = SITE_URL;
const title = "Privacy Policy";
const description = "How AngelDone collects, uses, and protects information, including how Google AdSense and Google Analytics use cookies on this site.";
const url = `${site}/en/privacy-policy`;
const lastUpdated = "July 27, 2026";
---

<LayoutEn title={title} description={description} canonical={url}>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <nav class="text-sm text-angel-muted mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
      <a href="/en/" class="hover:text-angel-primary transition-colors">Home</a>
      <span>›</span>
      <span class="text-angel-text">Privacy Policy</span>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-angel-text mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-angel-muted mb-10">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-angel-muted leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-angel-text mb-3">Overview</h2>
        <p>
          AngelDone (this site) is a static, editorial website about angel numbers and numerology.
          We don't require you to create an account, and we don't operate a database of user
          profiles. This policy explains what information is collected automatically as you browse,
          how advertising cookies work on this site, and what choices you have.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-angel-text mb-3">Information we collect</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          We don't ask visitors to sign up, log in, or submit personal information to read this
          site. The information collected falls into two categories:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-angel-text">Standard technical logs.</strong> Like most websites,
            our hosting provider automatically records basic technical information for every visit
            — things like IP address, browser type, device type, and which pages were requested.
            This is standard infrastructure logging used for security and reliability, not for
            identifying individual visitors.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-angel-text">Cookies from Google.</strong> This site uses Google
            Analytics to understand aggregate traffic patterns (how many people visit, which pages
            are popular) and Google AdSense to display advertising. Both set cookies in your
            browser, described in detail below.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-angel-text mb-3">Google AdSense and advertising cookies</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          This site uses third-party advertising companies, including Google, to serve ads when you
          visit. These companies may use information about your visits to this site and other
          websites (not including your name, address, email address, or telephone number) in order
          to provide advertisements about goods and services of interest to you.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-3">
          Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads on this site. Google's use of
          advertising cookies (including the DoubleClick/DART cookie) enables it and its partners to
          serve ads based on your visits to this site and/or other sites on the internet.
        </p>
        <p>
          You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google's Ads Settings at{" "}
          <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-angel-primary hover:text-angel-accent">
            www.google.com/settings/ads
          </a>. Alternatively, you can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for
          personalized advertising by visiting{" "}
          <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-angel-primary hover:text-angel-accent">
            www.aboutads.info
          </a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-angel-text mb-3">Google Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We use Google Analytics to understand, in aggregate, how visitors use this site — which
          pages get read, roughly how much traffic the site gets, and similar usage patterns. This
          data is used to improve the site's content and structure, not to identify or track
          individual visitors personally.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-angel-text mb-3">How we use information</h2>
        <p>
          Aggregate analytics data is used only to understand and improve this site. We do not sell
          personal information, and we do not use any collected data for direct marketing, since we
          don't collect email addresses or contact details through normal browsing. If you email us
          directly through our <a href="/en/contact" class="text-angel-primary hover:text-angel-accent">contact page</a>,
          we use that information only to respond to you.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-angel-text mb-3">Third-party links</h2>
        <p>
          Pages on this site may link to external resources for context. We aren't responsible for
          the privacy practices or content of external sites, and we'd encourage you to review the
          privacy policy of any site you navigate to from here.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-angel-text mb-3">Children's privacy</h2>
        <p>
          This site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal
          information from children.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-angel-text mb-3">Your choices</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>Opt out of personalized Google ads: <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-angel-primary hover:text-angel-accent">google.com/settings/ads</a></li>
          <li>Opt out of participating vendors' cookies: <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-angel-primary hover:text-angel-accent">aboutads.info</a></li>
          <li>Most browsers let you block or delete cookies directly in your browser settings.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-angel-text mb-3">Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time, for example if we add a new service or
          change how ads are served. The "last updated" date at the top of this page reflects the
          most recent revision.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-angel-text mb-3">Contact us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this privacy policy, you can reach us through our{" "}
          <a href="/en/contact" class="text-angel-primary hover:text-angel-accent">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 text-center">
      <a href="/en/" class="text-angel-primary hover:text-angel-accent transition-colors text-sm">← Home</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</LayoutEn>
